Package: DataDNA
Title: Data Frame Fingerprints and Lineage Figures
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Tony", "Lu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "xulunt123@gmail.com")
    )
Description: Profiles R data frames as compact data fingerprints using schema,
    shape, missingness, distribution, category, uniqueness, temporal, and role
    signals without external package dependencies. It compares versions,
    detects column renames and drift mutations, identifies close relatives in a
    library of historical data sets, and renders self-contained HTML cards plus
    static PNG, PDF, and SVG figures for reports.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/TonyIsFool/DataDNA
BugReports: https://github.com/TonyIsFool/DataDNA/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
